---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { TSBPA_FIRM_LICENSED, FIRM } from '../config';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Kanon Tax & Advisory"
  description="Terms governing use of the Kanon Tax & Advisory website."
  h1="Terms of use"
  lede={`Last updated ${FIRM.legalUpdated}`}
  crumbs={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Terms' }]}
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:24px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          These terms govern your use of kanonadvisory.com. By using the site you accept them. They
          govern the website only — the terms of any professional engagement are set out in a separate
          engagement letter, which controls if the two ever conflict.
        </p>

        <h2>1. No client relationship</h2>
        <p>
          Using this site, or sending us a message through it, does not create a
          client relationship and does not obligate either of us. That relationship begins only when we
          have both signed an engagement letter. Until then, do not send confidential information and do
          not rely on anything here as advice.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Professional disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Information on this site is general and informational.
          {TSBPA_FIRM_LICENSED
            ? ' While we are a licensed CPA firm, nothing published here constitutes tax, legal, or financial advice for your individual situation.'
            : ' While our services are provided by a licensed CPA, nothing published here constitutes tax, legal, or financial advice for your individual situation.'}
          Seek professional advice addressing your specific facts before acting. Our full
          <a href="/disclosures/"> disclosures</a> describe the scope and limits of our services.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Accuracy and currency</h2>
        <p>
          Tax law changes frequently. Content is accurate to the best of our knowledge as of the date
          shown on it and may be out of date when you read it. We are under no obligation to update it.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this site is owned by {FIRM.name} or its licensors. You may read, print, and share
          it for personal, non-commercial use with attribution. You may not republish, sell, or
          redistribute it, or use it to train a commercial model, without written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-party links and services</h2>
        <p>
          We link to outside websites, and the contact form is processed by a third-party provider. We do
          not control those services and are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided as-is. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties
          and are not liable for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, this website. Nothing
          here limits liability that cannot be limited by law, including for fraud.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may revise these terms. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept it.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>Reach us through <a href="/contact/">our contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
